@overheard night
// Writer-commons, overheard batch 1. The night shift, and the hand-over at either end of it.

== overheard
? pair:any+any time:night act:work
A: Quiet one.
B: Don't say that.
A: Why not?
B: It hears you.   #funny

? pair:any+any time:morning
A: Anything happen overnight?
B: The tea ran out at three.
A: A crisis, then.
B: We coped.   #funny

? pair:any+any time:night
A: Stars are good tonight.
B: Stars are always good. It's space.
A: Still. Look at them.   #warm

? pair:any+any time:night act:meal
A: Is this breakfast or dinner?
B: Yes.   #funny

? pair:any+any time:evening
A: Off to bed?
B: Off to work.
A: Night shift? Sorry.
B: Don't be. It's the best view on the ship.
